A RESOLUTION OF BOTH HOUSES TO CONVENE THE SENATE AND THE HOUSE OF
REPRESENTATIVES, EIGHTEENTH CONGRESS, INTO A CONSTITUENT ASSEMBLY IN PROPOSING AMENDMENTS TO SECTION 7, ARTICLE VI ON LEGISLATIVE DEPARTMENT;
SECTION 4, ARTICLE VII ON EXECUTIVE DEPARTMENT; AND SECTION 8, ARTICLE X ON LOCAL GOVERNMENT OF THE 1987 CONSTITUTION OF THE REPUBLIC OF THE PHILIPPINES
